{"id":"5152fdccfe1e0c8e","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-delta2-restraint-limit.md","title":"Δ₂ 历史保持限制最终有界且稳定","display":"lem-delta2-restraint-limit — Δ₂ 历史保持限制最终有界且稳定","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-delta2-restraint-limit","aliases":["20-lem-delta2-restraint-limit"],"display":"lem-delta2-restraint-limit — Δ₂ 历史保持限制最终有界且稳定","chapter":"7","section":"7.6","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 7.6.1 验证中所需的限制稳定性展开","source_printed_pages":[161],"source_pdf_pages":[195],"depends_on":["[[20-df-maximal-agreement]]","[[20-df-injury-elements]]","[[20-lem-use-preservation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-delta2-restraint-limit"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-delta2-restraint-limit</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-delta2-restraint-limit — Δ₂ 历史保持限制最终有界且稳定"},{"key":"chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"section","html":"7.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 7.6.1 验证中所需的限制稳定性展开"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>161</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>195</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"02f37a11ca2f55ac\" href=\"?note=02f37a11ca2f55ac\" title=\"20-df-maximal-agreement\">20-df-maximal-agreement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"18e11f4651f28406\" href=\"?note=18e11f4651f28406\" title=\"20-df-injury-elements\">20-df-injury-elements</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fec296dc8eb84564\" href=\"?note=fec296dc8eb84564\" title=\"20-lem-use-preservation\">20-lem-use-preservation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>采用上游 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_s,c,C_s,m,r_*\">\\(A_s,c,C_s,m,r_*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 非可计算；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\omega\">\\(e\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\operatorname{InjElem}(A_\\bullet,r_*,e)|&lt;\\omega\">\\(|\\operatorname{InjElem}(A_\\bullet,r_*,e)|&lt;\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"02f37a11ca2f55ac\" href=\"?note=02f37a11ca2f55ac\" title=\"20-df-maximal-agreement\">20-df-maximal-agreement</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"18e11f4651f28406\" href=\"?note=18e11f4651f28406\" title=\"20-df-injury-elements\">20-df-injury-elements</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fec296dc8eb84564\" href=\"?note=fec296dc8eb84564\" title=\"20-lem-use-preservation\">20-lem-use-preservation</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}delta2\\text{-}restraint\\text{-}limit}\\vdash\n\\exists M,r_0,s_0\\in\\omega\\ \\forall s\\ge s_0\\ [m(e,s)=M\\land r_*(e,s)=r_0].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}delta2\\text{-}restraint\\text{-}limit}\\vdash\n\\exists M,r_0,s_0\\in\\omega\\ \\forall s\\ge s_0\\ [m(e,s)=M\\land r_*(e,s)=r_0].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>取最后一次损伤后的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m(e,s)\">\\(m(e,s)\\)</span> 无界，则输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 时搜索 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s&gt;v\">\\(s&gt;v\\)</span>，同时要求当前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell(e,s)&gt;p\">\\(\\ell(e,s)&gt;p\\)</span>。虽然 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 可以保留旧的记录，无界性仍保证当前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\">\\(\\ell\\)</span> 在任意晚阶段达到超过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 的值。此时得到的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 上停止输出，因以后 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;p\">\\(m&gt;p\\)</span> 始终受保护而永久不变。在更晚的、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell&gt;p\">\\(\\ell&gt;p\\)</span> 的阶段，该同一输出又等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c(p,t)\">\\(c(p,t)\\)</span>；后者逐点稳定，故该输出等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_C(p)\">\\(\\chi_C(p)\\)</span>。于是此搜索计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>，矛盾。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 有界，单调整数函数最终恒为某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=M\">\\(m=M\\)</span> 且不再损伤以后，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\le M\">\\(x\\le M\\)</span> 一旦出现停止计算，其 use 便永久受到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_*\">\\(r_*\\)</span> 覆盖，所以计算与 use 保持。这样的输入只有有限多个，取所有首次停止阶段的最大值；此后停止输入集合及其 use 都固定，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_*\">\\(r_*\\)</span> 也固定。某些输入永不停止并不妨碍该有限最大值。这一补充验证使原书“沿用相同证明”中的限制稳定条件显式可引用。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 7.6.1 验证中所需的限制稳定性展开；印刷页 161；PDF 第 195 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-maximal-agreement","status":"resolved","id":"02f37a11ca2f55ac","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-maximal-agreement]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-injury-elements","status":"resolved","id":"18e11f4651f28406","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-injury-elements]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-use-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"fec296dc8eb84564","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-use-preservation]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-maximal-agreement","status":"resolved","id":"02f37a11ca2f55ac","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-maximal-agreement]]；see [[20-df-injury-elements]]；see [[20-lem-use-preservation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-injury-elements","status":"resolved","id":"18e11f4651f28406","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-maximal-agreement]]；see [[20-df-injury-elements]]；see [[20-lem-use-preservation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-use-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"fec296dc8eb84564","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-maximal-agreement]]；see [[20-df-injury-elements]]；see [[20-lem-use-preservation]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A_s,c,C_s,m,r_*","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"e\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"|\\operatorname{InjElem}(A_\\bullet,r_*,e)|<\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}delta2\\text{-}restraint\\text{-}limit}\\vdash\n\\exists M,r_0,s_0\\in\\omega\\ \\forall s\\ge s_0\\ [m(e,s)=M\\land r_*(e,s)=r_0].","display":true},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"m(e,s)","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"s>v","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell(e,s)>p","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"m>p","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell>p","display":false},{"tex":"c(p,t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_C(p)","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"m=M","display":false},{"tex":"x\\le M","display":false},{"tex":"r_*","display":false},{"tex":"r_*","display":false}],"bytes":2243,"backlinks":[{"id":"38ffff953003d9fb","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-uniform-delta2-sequence]]；see [[20-df-maximal-agreement]]；see [[20-lem-delta2-preservation]]；see [[20-lem-delta2-restraint-limit]]；see [[20-thm-single-event-enumeration]]；see [[20-df-re]]。"},{"id":"11bbbd83a4b964cf","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-maximal-agreement]]；see [[20-lem-delta2-preservation]]；see [[20-lem-delta2-restraint-limit]]；see [[20-df-simple]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-303","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-lem-delta2-restraint-limit]] — 章 7；直接提供者 3 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-303","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-lem-delta2-restraint-limit]]"}],"outgoing":["02f37a11ca2f55ac","18e11f4651f28406","fec296dc8eb84564"]}